    "result_text": "The build is green. Here's what I changed and why it satisfies the spec with low structural impact.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Version-2 identity (V2 tag mixed *inside* the identifiers only):**\n- `AssignOwnerCustomerCode.java` \u2014 the region code embedded in `memberId` becomes `Locality.of(owner) + \"V2\"`, so the id now reads e.g. `NSWV226\u2026` instead of `NSW26\u2026`.\n- `HouseholdId.java` / `IdentityKey.java` \u2014 each SHA-256 seed is prefixed with the fixed `\"V2|\"` tag. This changes every hash while preserving the equality partitions (a constant added to every seed), so the household- and identity-uniqueness checks keep the same grouping semantics but no v1 value can recur.\n\n**Plain user-facing fields untouched:** `Locality` (\u2192 `locality`), `Timezone`, and `OwnerSegment`'s derived region still use the plain region code \u2014 the `\"V2\"` tag appears *only* inside the three identifiers.\n\n**Response shape (`openapi.yml` + `OwnerMapper.java`):**\n- New `OwnerIdentity` schema groups `memberId` / `identityKey` / `householdId`; these are removed from the top level and exposed under a nested `identity` object.\n- Added a top-level integer `apiVersion` of `2`.\n- The mapper maps both in two `@Mapping` expressions; every response path already flows through `toOwnerDto`.\n\n**Audit schema v2 (`RespondWithOwnerCreated.java`):** the event now carries `\"schemaVersion\":2` and a recomputed `ownerSegment` (from `OwnerSegment.of`, whose region stays plain), alongside the now-v2 `memberId`.\n\n**Keeping structural cost down:** every function I changed lives in a tiny single-method class (WMC_other \u2248 1) and I edited one or two lines each; the derivation changes are one-liners with the `\"V2\"` tag inlined rather than introducing a new helper class, which avoided adding an extra file to the multiplier.\n\nThe only test (`AcceptanceTest.coreV2GroupsIdentityAndVersions`) passes, and the audit output confirms the new shape: `{\"schemaVersion\":2,\u2026,\"memberId\":\"NSWV22716E6609E7\",\u2026,\"ownerSegment\":\"STANDARD_METRO\",\"event\":\"OWNER_CREATED\"}`.",
